equired parser-driven manual residual review for 12/12. MinerU required semantic correction for 9/12 and parser-driven manual residual review for 10/12. Both-clean-without-residual was 0/12, so neither parser nor naive consensus can produce formal question truth.\n\nCampaign A #1550 and children #1552–#1558 are now superseded and closed as not planned. Replacement control-plane issue #1575 defines a separate three-day image-first minimal visual truth pilot; it does not start AO execution.\n\n## Strict scope\n\nThis PR contains only reports, one compact JSON artifact and report-index registration. It intentionally excludes all QuestionRegion, checker, Gold, sealed, custody, ledger, schema, validator, workflow, test and remediation implementation from #1572/#1573.\n\nHistorical Gold artifacts remain immutable invalidated evidence and are not relabeled, deleted or consumed as current formal truth.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Docling report SHA-256: `baf2455af55dfd5da00eaaa21343b835f160eb70dd3cb192db5d3afd7d3911e3`\n- MinerU report SHA-256: `6f38a12a631e3d5c01700aeb7460921f31b61dd5fe896d76fea414b92c92de18`\n- compact JSON parse/count check: pass\n- `npm run quality:report-index`: pass\n- `git diff --check`: pass\n\nProvider calls: 0. CNY: 0. Remote data writes: 0. Sealed access: 0. Production/public display: 0.\n\nRelated to #1550 and #1575. No issue auto-close directive is used.\n","created_at":"2026-07-16T01:39:22Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T02:47:39Z","closed_at":"2026-07-16T02:47:39Z","merged_at":"2026-07-16T02:47:39Z","merge_commit_sha":"b42588ea72a434be8bb75f0ed990cd40caeeaac5","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1577/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1577/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","co